OrangeIslands_Mikan_House2_Text_PoolKeeper::
	.string "I keep CISSY's pool. You will not\n"
	.string "walk to her -- you SURF, and the\l"
	.string "water does the steering.\p"
	.string "Three rocks between the door and\n"
	.string "her LEADER's stand, each one\l"
	.string "behind its own channel.\p"
	.string "Pick the wrong column and the\n"
	.string "outflow puts you back at the\l"
	.string "bottom. It is not cruel. It is\l"
	.string "just how water works.$"

OrangeIslands_Mikan_House2_Text_Partner::
	.string "He rode that maze all summer and\n"
	.string "she still beat him in the rain.$"

